e resident galleries**\n\n- **The Grand Salon**: a monumental hall of European masters, from Leonardo to Van Gogh, with Raphael's *School of Athens* commanding its own wall\n- **The Focused Exhibit**: Impressionism and modern visions, from Monet's light to Seurat's Sunday afternoon\n- **The Vault**: an intimate jewel box of Japanese masterworks, home to Hokusai's *Great Wave*\n\n**Infinite exhibitions**\n\nSearch all of art history. If it's in the public domain, you can hang it: verified, attributed, and rendered at museum resolution on your walls.\n\n**Every work, up close**\n\nStep in to inspect brushwork at full resolution. Read the story behind each piece on gallery wall text, just like the real thing.\n\n**A soundtrack to match**\n\nClassical works fill the halls, opening with Vivaldi's Four Seasons.\n\nNo tickets. No crowds. No closing time. Just you and five centuries of painting.", "short_description": "Step into a museum with no walls on its collection. Wander three grand galleries hung with masterpieces, then search all of art history and hang public-domain works in your own exhibition, drawn live from the world's collections."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://happyfire-engine.dev/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "HappyFire Engine LLC", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://happyfire-engine.dev/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "726368587961803"}, {"id": "434961926215971"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE", "SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "2107038993488922"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1573648951128434"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1573648951128434"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1785955680, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1573648951128434"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "2108758149983673", "version": "6"}, "id": "1017823637642071", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "2107038986822256", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "2108758149983673"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1017823637642071"}]}, "change_log": "Initial release. Explore three curated gallery rooms the Grand Salon, the Focused Exhibit, and the Vault, or search all of art history and hang public-domain masterpieces in your own exhibition. Classical soundtrack featuring Vivaldi's Four Seasons.", "created_date": 1784483527, "id": "2108758149983673", "version": "6", "version_code": 6, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}